Client Layer: Web, mobile, external apps.

API Gateway: Single entry point, handles auth, rate limiting, routing.

Services / Microservices: Modular services (User, Post, Notification, etc.).

Database Layer: SQL for relational, NoSQL for scale, plus cache.

Message Queue: Decouple services for async tasks.

Analytics / Notification: Optional downstream systems for logs, metrics, emails, or push notifications.